  "label": "User projected onto the scene of joyful Black individuals carrying each other on a beach",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the scene depicting two Black men carrying women on their backs in a joyful, recreational setting on a beach. This projection is implicit, as the meme uses the visual of happiness and playfulness to contrast with the harmful stereotype of economic desperation implied by the text. The user sees themselves or their group as being in a similar situation of active, joyful engagement, despite the meme's misleading and stereotypical textual overlay.",
